            "id": "https://sacrellfarch.github.io/posts/2026-07-12-",
            "content_html": "<blockquote>\n<p>仍旧随笔，于是散漫的thx同学如是写下：</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>独居生活</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>我想，我大概永远都不会原谅58同城和象盒</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>在六月末的时候，cry就已经向我提及暑假的租房计划，彼时，我还认为租房是一件易如反掌的</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://sacrellfarch.github.io/posts/2026-07-12-\" target=\"_blank\">https://sacrellfarch.github.io/posts/2026-07-12-</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
